// input: after idr-optimize
// FILECHECK-OPTIONS: --implicit-check-not=str.length --implicit-check-not={{con[[:space:]].*Main[.]L[^.A-Za-z0-9_]}}
// A value picked at runtime is an ordinary value. A match whose consumer
// folds against its alternatives takes the consumer into each of them
// (case-of-case): the function and the Lazy value
// picked are applied where they are known, and each string's length is a
// constant. The list of runtime elements is specialized on its shape, so
// no box is built at runtime. What is left matches on the runtime
// characters.
// CHECK: io.get_byte
// CHECK: match_lit
